conquer the leaderboards and unlock all the score medallions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/78860073b56229fad7fa7b80e304d19f.poster.avif?t=1780910888\" width=768 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/78860073b56229fad7fa7b80e304d19f.webm?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/78860073b56229fad7fa7b80e304d19f.mp4?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and frantic twin stick action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 28 varied levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expert difficulty for expert players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Biscuits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/03c1eb1d9597a8d18f71bfa302cbdd7d.poster.avif?t=1780910888\" width=768 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/03c1eb1d9597a8d18f71bfa302cbdd7d.webm?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/03c1eb1d9597a8d18f71bfa302cbdd7d.mp4?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Son of Scoregasm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 28 varied levels full of enemies, traps, lasers and bosses in this explosive Twin Stick Shmup! Test your skills, find new paths, master the score mechanics and become bullet hell. Tight score attack play, fast combat and online Leaderboards leave you needing just one more go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/33918befffcf97462404d6cc7f812517.poster.avif?t=1780910888\" width=768 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/33918befffcf97462404d6cc7f812517.webm?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/33918befffcf97462404d6cc7f812517.mp4?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight past hordes of enemies, unlock new routes on the map and defeat seven fearsome robot bosses to save the galaxy! Practice any stage in Score-Attack mode to perfect your skills, conquer the leaderboards and unlock all the score medallions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/78860073b56229fad7fa7b80e304d19f.poster.avif?t=1780910888\" width=768 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/78860073b56229fad7fa7b80e304d19f.webm?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/631490/extras/78860073b56229fad7fa7b80e304d19f.mp4?t=1780910888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and frantic twin stick action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 28 varied levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expert difficulty for expert players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Biscuits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
